OL,3,GNEWSALondon mayor Sadiq Khan sworn into
OL,4,AHouse of Lords
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Mayor of London, Sir Sadiq Khan,
OL,7,Fhas taken his place in the House of
OL,8,FLords.
OL,10,FSir Sadiq, who has become Lord Khan of
OL,11,FTooting, took the oath in the upper
OL,12,Fchamber at the start of business as he
OL,13,Fbecame a Labour member of the Lords.
OL,15,FAbout a dozen London Labour MPs,
OL,16,Fincluding Dawn Butler (Brent East),
OL,17,FTulip Siddiq (Hampstead and Highgate)
OL,18,Fand Rupa Huq (Ealing Central and Acton)
OL,19,Fwatched on from the bar of the Lords
OL,20,Falong with members of Lord Khan's
OL,21,Ffamily.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
