OL,3,GNEWSALondon mayor Sadiq Khan sworn into
OL,4,AHouse of Lords
OL,5,
OL,6,FLord Khan has become one of the
OL,7,Fforemost Labour politicians in Britain
OL,8,Fafter his decade as London mayor. His
OL,9,Ftenure, after being elected in 2016,
OL,10,Fhas made him the longest-serving mayor
OL,11,Fof London since its creation in 2000.
